==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|передати}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*perdati}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*per-}} + {{m|sla-pro|*dati}}. {{surf|ru|пере-|дать}}. {{doublet|ru|преда́ть}}, a borrowing from Old Church Slavonic.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|переда́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-передать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|переда́ть|pf|impf=передава́ть}}

# to [[hand over]], to [[deliver]], to [[give]]
# to [[broadcast]], to [[transmit]]
# to [[reproduce]], to [[render]]
# to [[tell]], to take a [[message]]

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|irreg/c,c(1)+p|переда́ть|past_m_tail=*|past_n_tail=*|past_p_tail=*|notes=* Less common.}}

